          "content": "28pt identity + known children only: 24pt row. First child uses status, provider and body title; +N inspects remaining children in the native shell; the web Workspace shows every direct child with Component / Pane child row. Titles come from canonical metadata. Zero / one / many and 240pt Korean states reuse this master. Core async operation state stays in the pane header; unknown activity blocks close until Check status completes.",
