        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sys-dropdown-menu-spec",
          "name": "Shaped from shadcn’s Dropdow",
          "content": "Shaped from shadcn’s Dropdown (cTN8T) for the open content (rounded-sm, --popover fill, hairline --border, no drop shadow) and List Item/List Divider (2JGXl, D24KC) for each row: --radius-xs items, --accent highlight, a `line`-type separator. The trigger itself has no shadcn master and is drawn as a --secondary control. Context Menu draws the identical menu content over a point anchor. Menu Item and Separator are their own reusable masters (mnu-item-m, mnu-sep-m) - every Component sheet that draws a menu row points at them instead of hand-drawing one.",
